# Smoke test of the runner (not a spec): a tap of Shift switches the input language once, though Chromium and Electron
# hand every modifier change over twice; the letters typed in English go in once each, though their keys come twice.
NAME     a tap of Shift switches the language once, and English goes in as typed
PROFILES all
LANG     chinese
KEY      shift
EXPECT   lang english
EXPECT   switches 1
TYPE     Hi
EXPECT   doc "Hi"
KEY      shift
EXPECT   lang chinese
EXPECT   switches 1
EXPECT   nolost
